      "kind": "civil_penalty",
      "text": "B. Failure to pay any fee required by subpart A of this Section is an unlawful act and, except as otherwise provided by Section 2, is subject to the assessment of a civil penalty of not more than $100 per day, until the fee is paid in full.",
      "applies_to": [
